The '''warped sceptre''' is a [[powered staff]] requiring 62 [[Magic]] to wield, available as a drop from [[Warped Terrorbird|warped terrorbird]]s or [[Warped Tortoise|warped tortoise]]s with level 56 [[Slayer]]. Like most powered staves, it is only tradeable when it is fully uncharged.

Its cast speed gives it an improved damage output compared to the [[Iban's staff]] (at 81 or higher Magic), but less than the [[trident of the seas]]. This is particularly useful for midgame [[Ironman Mode|ironmen players]] who are unable to kill [[Cave kraken]]s. Additionally, the fact that the runes it uses are stored within the staff makes it useful over the Iban's staff (which doesn't store runes) when inventory slots are scarce. 

On death in the wilderness, if you have the sceptre as one of your protected items, it will not lose charges. The built-in spell cannot be used against other players in the wilderness. 

[[File:Warped sceptre spell.gif|thumb|250px|A player using the warped sceptre's built in spell.]]

