==Charging==
To use the sceptre's magic spell, it must be charged with [[earth rune|earth]] and [[chaos rune]]s, holding up to 20,000 charges when fully charged. Each cast requires 2 chaos runes and 5 earth runes, costing {{NoCoins|{{GEP|Chaos rune|2}}+{{GEP|Earth rune|5}}|c}} per cast. Players can configure the charges while the sceptre is in their bank by right-clicking on Configure-Charges, as long as players have the required materials. Uncharging the sceptre grants all the runes back. Casting continuously results in 25 casts a minute up to 1,500 casts per hour. 

