==Maximum hit==
The base [[Maximum Magic hit|maximum hit]] dealt by the sceptre is dependent on the player's current [[Magic]] level, starting at 16 with level 62, up to a maximum of 24 at level 99.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1701910078675157295|date=13 September 2023|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/105162|archivedate=13 September 2023|quote=Interpolates linearly between 16 at level 62 and 24 at level 99 (and higher for visible Magic boosts).}} Both magic damage bonuses and visible stat boosts will modify the max hit of the spell; likewise, stat-reductions will lower the damage. Invisible boosts, such as from the sceptre's attack styles, do not affect the max hit.

<math>\begin{align}
\text{Max Hit} &= \left\lfloor \frac{8(\text{Magic Level}) + 96}{37} \right\rfloor
\end{align}</math>

